00:37:14.210 --> 00:37:17.430
Know who was really good at that right off the bat was Amy AdaMs.
知道谁一开始就很擅长这个吗，是艾米·亚当斯。

731
00:37:17.430 --> 00:37:22.930
I'll never forget, because it was kind of a learned strength, I think, on the show, to
