Was that it?
是那个吗？

740
00:37:50.390 --> 00:37:51.110
Hot Girl.
《辣妹》。

741
00:37:51.250 --> 00:37:51.710
Hot Girl.
《辣妹》。

742
00:37:51.930 --> 00:37:52.470
She was selling purses.
她在卖包包。

743
00:37:52.470 --> 00:37:53.150
Selling the purses.
在卖包包。

744
00:37:53.230 --> 00:37:53.830
Selling purses, yeah.
卖包包，对。

